      "*"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_XLlhigl3lQjAsmGl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>FAQ</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Fm7Sx4LsmyNq7ecf",
      "label": "Subtitle",
      "default": "<p>Still have questions?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "url_ZQDo5h1tncqNXSoh",
      "label": "Button URL"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_51MVT4piI5MLF7a0",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Get in touch</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_title_NEDiiHOu0ukoJGJ2",
      "label": "Product",
      "default": "Product & Experience"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_xxgTYQmmQuYtZ0yt",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>What does it taste like?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gjXDppQvzHAYhhdk",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>If you&apos;re used to vapor, Lio may not be as strong as you&apos;d expect at first. Lio can be compared to a herbal tea if vapor was compared to a sticky soda. Not as sweet, and a lot more natural.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_n0ldEFlc1uhHzXnq",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>What is Lio?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_R8IkbtGrbvrVm07W",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio is a natural habit-breaking device that uses aromatherapy to support behavioral change without nicotine, chemicals, or harmful additives. It works through olfactory engagement, the science of how scent influences your brain and behavior.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ogvCJxGGfTvpyphk",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How does Lio work?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_FMPm5Eit6Ov93X2G",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Stopping a bad habit cold turkey is challenging. Lio helps by replacing your hand-to-mouth ritual, encouraging deep breaths, engaging your sense of smell, and providing immediate sensory satisfaction with natural aromatherapy. You&apos;re breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics, no nicotine, no chemicals, no vapor.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_OTfSsTtIoveySVyb",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How can something with no nicotine actually work?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_FYZCZwlIJcziKwbn",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Here&apos;s what most people don&apos;t know: habits aren&apos;t just about the substance. Research shows behavioral patterns play a major role, the hand-to-mouth motion, the deep breathing, the sensory triggers. Lio targets these behavioral patterns by providing a natural ritual replacement. Your brain doesn&apos;t just crave the substance, it craves the entire experience. That&apos;s why customers say it \"works like magic\" even without nicotine.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_NgFxUQ5ZmocemyNP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>This looks like another wellness gimmick. Is it really different?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Ef0TgmjZFhqxaCFI",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio isn&apos;t based on Instagram trends. It&apos;s designed based on principles of olfactory science and behavioral psychology, combined with traditional aromatherapy practices. We have served 100,000+ customers across 50+ countries. Our devices are produced in the Netherlands with premium-quality materials. This is a wellness device informed by behavioral science, not a lifestyle accessory.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_g4sR5gDX1VhUIiYG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Will Lio satisfy the ritual aspects of my habit?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_tv8bdwKz4GJ7cP0p",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio is designed to address the behavioral and sensory aspects of your habit: the satisfaction from natural aromatics, the hand-to-mouth ritual, the calming effect of deep breathing, and the immediate sensory reward. You&apos;re not resisting the urge, you&apos;re replacing it with a healthier pattern. As one customer said: \"The sensory satisfaction is surprisingly effective.\"</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_qskGcfv7oOia8hnS",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Will it work for my specific habit?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_CdmXG6ZZFjr144wo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio works for any behavior driven by ritual and sensory triggers: repetitive hand-to-mouth behaviors, stress-related patterns, oral fixations, and habitual routines. The common thread isn&apos;t the substance, it&apos;s the pattern. If your habit involves repetitive motion and immediate sensory gratification, Lio&apos;s ritual replacement approach can help.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_title_EzgcnF7MLdzarsTf",
      "label": "Safety",
      "default": "SAFETY & INGREDIENTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_xNLgV0v7IM73nB1y",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Is Lio safe?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_HcBQ93CKxxk4rdOm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Yes. Multiple 3rd party toxicology reports and studies have been done on the inhalation of the plant compounds we use. We&apos;re committed to funding ongoing research. BreatheLio offers a natural, chemical-free approach to changing habits.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_pNa3x3Z5wRO0Hb7s",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>What are Flavour Cores made of?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_fX4dG9Lkec9O1Og5",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core is made from premium-quality polyester fiber infused with 100% organic natural essential oils from IFRA-certified EU farms. We use premium-grade aromatics from certified manufacturers and natural plant extracts like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and botanical aromas. Everything is blended in The Netherlands where we combine science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_uSDHoqJKix0ZDbih",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Does Lio contain nicotine?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_TXOY8bl8CCM9xHdv",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>No. Lio is 100% nicotine-free. You&apos;re breathing pure air with natural aromatics while satisfying the behavioral patterns that make change so difficult.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7h5Ii3mj90Iv7LHa",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Is Lio vegan and allergen-free?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_A278UNVYKPOYhccO",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Yes! Every aroma is 100% natural, vegan, and allergen-free. Safe to use anywhere, anytime, even after you&apos;ve brushed your teeth.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_XD4qnzdlUEkcZf0y",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Where do your ingredients come from?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_vlWQuaNYfngS9u8r",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>All ingredients come from European IFRA-certified farms. Our premium-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only. If you&apos;re used to vapor, Lio may not be as strong as you&apos;d expect at first. Lio can be compared to a herbal tea if vapor was compared to a sticky soda. Not as sweet, and a lot more natural.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tab_title_LXoOgNeKik7BrtAy",
      "label": "Usage",
      "default": "USAGE & RESULTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_ILWHfUA6SjHPWKjJ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How do the Flavour Cores work?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_46NemNwWQfPfcEgY",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core contains natural essential oils and plant extracts held in a premium-quality fiber matrix. As you inhale, air flows through the Core and picks up natural aromatics that engage your olfactory system, providing sensory satisfaction while you work on changing behavioral patterns.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gbHnbNcMOMrJ5QPF",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How long do Flavour Cores last?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Mo27W9byB16cOmzl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core pack contains 3 Cores, providing 10+ days of flavor.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_EPooubRoa5qJjDnM",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>How often can I use Lio?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_4QdwpLAjbA8w6hdS",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>As often as you like, anywhere, anytime, even after you&apos;ve brushed your teeth! Please note: if Lio is negatively affecting you, stop and contact your physician.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_rDvIwVsB1MBVdQ4k",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>What results can I expect?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YKGVJZBwSdKiw97f",
      "label": "Text",
