        "text_FznwyH4lJtHmPgbN": "<h3>Do you offer free shipping?</h3>",
        "text_ldICCYGCNPCmbTag": "<p>Yes! Free shipping on all orders from €20.</p>",
        "text_jCL1JHnlKjibw6M8": "<h3>How fast is delivery?</h3>",
        "text_WBZBwGyCyRZo83SH": "<p>We provide 1-3 days delivery across our shipping regions.</p>",
        "text_plFLnuarTcqIppy6": "<h3>Where is Lio produced and shipped from?</h3>",
        "text_IGYtCzeGIvsGHYTa": "<p>Lio devices are produced in the Netherlands using the highest quality standards. We don&apos;t dropship, everything is manufactured locally and shipped directly from our Netherlands facility by our trusted shipping partners. You&apos;ll receive tracking information once your order is dispatched.</p>",
        "text_N98aExawHYBrpC6E": "<h3>What is your return policy?</h3>",
        "text_AH83tpWdS8guFEHI": "<p>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee. If you&apos;re not satisfied with Lio, you can return it within 30 days for a full refund. Try Lio risk-free for 30 days. If it doesn&apos;t help you break your habit, we&apos;ll refund your purchase. No questions asked.</p>",
